# Local development secrets for `vite dev` / `wrangler dev`.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) and fill in. Nothing here is needed yet —
# Phase 1 has no secrets. Open Food Facts requires no API key, only a
# descriptive User-Agent, which arrives in Phase 5.
#
# Example of what will land later:
# OPEN_FOOD_FACTS_USER_AGENT="Drank/0.1 (https://github.com/Carl-Bagnall/drank)"
